  S("corporate-term-loan","Corporate Term Loan","Medium to long-term loans to companies for capex, expansion or refinancing, assessed on balance sheet strength and cash flows.","Mid-size and large corporates.","Strong financial reporting speeds approval.","Is a rating needed?","Large lenders often use internal or external credit ratings."),
  S("project-and-infrastructure-finance","Project and Infrastructure Finance","Long-tenure financing for roads, power, telecom, renewable energy and real-estate projects, repaid from project cash flows.","Infrastructure sponsors and developers.","Approvals and offtake agreements are the foundation.","What are typical tenures?","Often 10 to 20 years for infrastructure."),
  S("real-estate-developer-finance","Real Estate Developer and Commercial Real Estate Finance","Funding for development and ownership of residential and commercial real estate, with escrow and RERA-linked controls.","Registered developers and commercial property owners.","RERA compliance and clear titles are critical.","What security is taken?","Land, project receivables and escrow accounts, among others."),
  S("renewable-energy-and-power-finance","Renewable Energy, Telecom and Power Sector Finance","Specialised lenders fund solar, wind, transmission, telecom towers and power plants, often with long-term PPAs.","Energy and telecom developers.","Long-term offtake contracts are central.","Is green financing available?","Several lenders have dedicated green and sustainability-linked products."),
  S("venture-debt-and-private-credit","Venture Debt and Private Credit","Non-bank lenders and funds provide structured debt to growth-stage companies, with flexible covenants and higher cost.","Venture-backed and growth-stage businesses.","Compare the total cost including fees and warrants.","How does venture debt differ from a bank loan?","It is more flexible and higher cost, and is backed by growth prospects rather than just assets."),
  S("mezzanine-bridge-and-acquisition-finance","Mezzanine, Bridge and Acquisition Finance","Short-term bridge loans, mezzanine capital and acquisition finance for M&A, promoter funding and takeover transactions.","Companies undertaking acquisitions or timing-sensitive deals.","Plan the refinancing or exit before signing a bridge loan.","How long is a bridge loan?","Typically from a few months to 2 years."),
